 start to run out, will allow you to make more timely decisions to adjust purchases, sales and promotions.<\/span><\/p><p class=\"p1\"><span class=\"s1\">\u2022 Process automation. Automating purchasing, reporting, inventory management, alerts, including payroll, analytics, and billing will allow your employees to focus on their tasks, reduce administrative errors, and gain customer satisfaction by providing better service.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-779baa3c\" data-id=\"779baa3c\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-296c56f elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"296c56f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"801\" src=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/06\/SAP-Canada-Emerson-Rush-2-2.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-488\" alt=\"SAP Canada benefits\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/06\/SAP-Canada-Emerson-Rush-2-2.jpg 976w, https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/06\/SAP-Canada-Emerson-Rush-2-2-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/06\/SAP-Canada-Emerson-Rush-2-2-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/06\/SAP-Canada-Emerson-Rush-2-2-768x769.jpg 768w, https:\/\/www.emersonrush.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/06\/SAP-Canada-Emerson-Rush-2-2-500x500.jpg 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"e